===Adjective===
{{en-adj}}

# [[foresee|Foresight]] an Irish term for foresight
# {{context|dialectal|or|archaic|lang=en}} About to die; [[fated]]; [[doomed]]; on the verge of sudden or violent death.
# {{context|obsolete|lang=en}} [[dying|Dying]]; [[dead]].
# (Chiefly Scottish) possessing [[second sight]], [[clairvoyance]], or [[clairaudience]]

